ria.\n3. The moon does not have an atmosphere that can cause water to vaporize.\n4. The moon does not undergo any chemical changes that would turn it into cheese or any other substance.\n5. The moon's phases are caused by the changing positions of the moon, Earth, and the sun. As the moon orbits Earth, different portions of its illuminated side are visible from our perspective.", "new_cot_probs": [1.1896581979351385e-14, 3.850644691993921e-09, 3.90073884922338e-14, 5.331678363238758e-14], "cot_prob": [-0.53125], "cot_step_prob": [-0.5703125]}, "2": {"completion": "B): alter the way the moon's fac", "probs": [3.900748674805568e-14, 1.0467164024419162e-08, 3.476699722386456e-13, 1.1287191071119446e-13], "prediction": 1, "target_cot_step": "The question is about moon phases.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Moon phases\n\nChoices:\n(A): change the moon into cheese\n(B): alter the way the moon's facade looks\n(C): change moon lakes into vapor\n(D): cause lunar eclipse every day\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n\n1.", "specificity_preds": [2, 0, 0, 2, 3, 1, 3, 3, 2, 1, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 3], "specificity_probs": [[9.510991820504966e-12, 2.7520964673843906e-11, 4.674432929618888e-08, 1.9103336967862816e-10], [1.3244053320704552e-07, 2.748715477451924e-09, 9.593959404696761e-09, 4.776551376650673e-10], [4.135371511893027e-08, 2.936834803124455e-11, 2.4347215216158347e-11, 1.9985413064055324e-12], [2.1410163572599394e-11, 1.774964723810779e-11, 4.6693756416971155e-08, 1.6840397132344975e-10], [3.5301622736128024e-11, 2.474834781551749e-09, 3.6008631632000743e-09, 5.632698218960286e-08], [1.7819069136892907e-11, 2.8431960785724186e-08, 2.0191650434986386e-11, 5.434509179474967e-12], [2.268500526314554e-10, 5.850540052421138e-09, 2.001944721108373e-10, 5.550838366730204e-08], [1.4848815232948454e-10, 6.18990622647253e-11, 2.4481558447142504e-10, 4.6653592988832315e-08], [1.1398138292581517e-12, 8.339056441902803e-13, 1.522760229022424e-08, 1.46354