t's survival in arid conditions.", "new_cot_probs": [1.52671098826258e-14, 6.687736475718964e-10, 6.491740738717722e-13, 9.352239170807089e-14], "cot_prob": [-1.4765625], "cot_step_prob": [-1.75]}}}
