{"id": "1759", "question": "Thermometers", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): can help you monitor a fever", "B): indicate levels of mercury in the blood", "C): read exactly at 98.6 degrees", "D): are used only for babies"], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. Thermometers are devices used to measure temperature.\n2. They can be used to monitor body temperature, which is helpful in determining if a person has a fever.\n3. Mercury thermometers contain mercury, but they do not indicate levels of mercury in the blood.\n4. The average body temperature is around 98.6 degrees Fahrenheit, but thermometers can read a range of temperatures.\n5. Thermometers are used for people of all ages, not just babies.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.7510048312251456e-05, 1.5215377402455488e-08, 1.1849746961445362e-08, 2.1703568109376903e-10], "initial_probs": [0.00015754028572700918, 6.438311856982182e-07, 7.295562909348519e-07, 7.689466485771845e-08], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "rt_lambda": 1.0, "cot_step": "Thermometers are devices used to measure temperature.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Thermometers are devices used to measure temperature.", "2.", "They can be used to monitor body temperature, which is helpful in determining if a person has a fever.", "3.", "Mercury thermometers contain mercury, but they do not indicate levels of mercury in the blood.", "4.", "The average body temperature is around 98.6 degrees Fahrenheit, but thermometers can read a range of temperatures.", "5.", "Thermometers are used for people of all ages, not just babies."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "A). Thermometers are devices used to", "probs": [0.00015742916730232537, 6.433770636249392e-07, 7.290417443073238e-07, 8.707161924803586e-08], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "Thermometers are devices used to measure temperature.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Thermometers\n\nChoices:\n(A): can help you monitor a fever\n(B): indicate levels of mercury in the blood\n(C): read exac