acteria.\n3. Planting rapeseed first would help increase the nitrogen content in the soil, which would benefit the subsequent soybean crop.\n4. By rotating rapeseed and soybeans, farmers can take advantage of the nitrogen-fixing properties of rapeseed to improve the growth and yield of soybeans.", "new_cot_probs": [5.3121020471280644e-08, 2.5928115557349862e-11, 1.477339257871524e-11, 1.7644303986624754e-12], "cot_prob": [-1.5078125], "cot_step_prob": [-1.609375]}, "3": {"completion": "A): get bigger yields.\n\nRotating", "probs": [3.287527476913965e-07, 1.124930282259129e-08, 4.44918519804105e-08, 3.926392366793152e-08], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "Bill planted rapeseed in his field one year.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Bill planted rapeseed in his field one year and soybeans the next in order to\n\nChoices:\n(A): get bigger yields\n(B): make things boring\n(C): keep things random\n(D): get smaller yields\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n\n1.", "specificity_preds": [2, 0, 0, 2, 3, 1, 3, 3, 2, 1, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 3], "specificity_probs": [[1.7171977617636003e-08, 7.158345027846735e-09, 3.7081144910189323e-06, 8.111467053595334e-09], [1.626423909328878e-06, 4.334273029371616e-08, 1.039737966834764e-07, 1.0958757457046886e-08], [6.46482078536792e-07, 1.101359670130364e-09, 1.5866591374091854e-10, 4.0117024285857283e-11], [3.5924976327095237e-09, 2.17896012344454e-09, 9.357493695461017e-07, 2.3194908216339627e-09], [1.1801795096744172e-09, 3.9082181046978803e-08, 1.2688125217152901e-08, 7.849865255593613e-07], [1.8159765913239312e-09, 9.406991807736631e-07, 8.578066590381184e-10, 4.591508284690349e-10], [5.862198282358122e-09, 3.626813338541979e-07, 4.56548443494853e-09, 1.6254251704594935e-06], [1.030619589670323e-08, 4.86830176171793e-09, 6.251023698666813e-09, 8.187225262190623e-07], [2.459295822543339e-10, 5.899544186505068e-10, 1.0666626621969044e-06, 1.316366182724238e-10], [4.594233327104291e-10, 4.4461853576649446e-0